# Yu Zhong, Black Dragon

> Yu Zhong wins fights that look like they're going against him. His passive converts sustained melee engagement into a regen engine: each 5-stack Sha Residue eruption deals HP-loss-based physical damage and restores a chunk of his own missing HP, which means every trade that drags on tilts in his favor. That loop is his identity, and managing it well is the entire game.

