- Wanwan (Marksman): +2.0 pp edge. Wanwan has a statistical edge over Yu Zhong based on ranked matchup data. Pick Wanwan to gain an advantage in draft.
- Claude (Marksman): +1.9 pp edge. Claude has a statistical edge over Yu Zhong based on ranked matchup data. Pick Claude to gain an advantage in draft.
