## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Default (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Oracle, Queen's Wings, Hunter Strike, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Oracle, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Thrill, Festival of Blood, War Cry
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when crowd control and magic poke are not deciding the first Turtle fight.; Brute Force Breastplate over Immortality when Use before true late game when movement speed, cooldown reduction, and control-duration reduction keep Sha Residue uptime higher than a revive.; Dominance Ice over Hunter Strike when Use when the enemy draft has regen, shields, or attack-speed carries that must hit Yu Zhong during the first dive.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use when burst magic can delete Yu Zhong before Oracle and Queen's Wings can stabilize the entry.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Default EXP setup for ranked games where Yu Zhong needs the War Axe, Oracle, and Queen's Wings sustain curve before chasing backline fights.

### Anti-Sustain Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Brute Force Breastplate, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use when fights are still mid-game brawls and the low-HP damage reduction is worth more than late-game revive insurance.; Antique Cuirass over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against repeated physical skill burst from EXP fighters or assassins that meet Yu Zhong before Sha Residue erupts.; Radiant Armor over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against repeated magic damage that stacks through long Turtle, Lord, or base fights.; Blade Armor over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when a basic-attack marksman is forced to hit Yu Zhong before reaching your back line.
- Total cost: 10660 gold

Durable EXP setup for drafts where Yu Zhong must take first contact, carry Lifebane, and survive long enough for repeated Cursing Touch eruptions.

### Damage Chase Flex (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Queen's Wings
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Festival of Blood, War Cry
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Oracle over Malefic Roar when Use when the enemy front line has not stacked armor and extra received healing matters more than penetration.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use when Yu Zhong must personally apply Lifebane to high-HP sustain targets instead of cutting through armor.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use only when ahead and allied control reliably puts targets below half HP before Yu Zhong's first Dragonoid recast.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against mixed skirmish damage when a shield and movement burst saves the first chase better than a late revive.
- Total cost: 11240 gold

Snowball-oriented EXP setup for games where another frontliner starts fights and Yu Zhong can use Flicker plus Hunter Strike tempo to chase carries.

